<p>Unstoppable mysterious wanderer? Freaky in an interesting sort of way.</p>
<p>I do have a question, though (just one, I swear): If this same man walks through the same town frequently, following something vaguely resembling a set routine, and is sufficiently distinctive to creep out people who look at him, shouldn't the sheer number of people who would recognize him prohibit the use of amnesiacs to keep his presence under wraps?</p>

